Error [E0150]: `bounce_ready` needs `v` in state `Unit`, but `v` is in state `Raw`
  --> tests/ui/typestate_wrong_state_free_function.jet:16:26
    |
 16 |     print("{bounce_ready(v)}")
    |                          ^
 Why: Typestate (D-STATE1): `bounce_ready` is only valid in state `Unit`; calling it in `Raw` is the out-of-order-events bug it prevents
 Fix: Transition it first: call `normalize` to reach `Unit`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150
